00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,530
♪ From primal chaos to the starry sky ♪

3
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪ In the whole world, we shall hold the balance ♪

4
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,916
♪ The cauldron tempers divine blades ♪

5
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪ The furnace refines the empty void ♪

6
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,906
♪ The Way is in mystic fate ♪

7
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪ Be brave enough to split the primal chaos wide open ♪

8
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,596
[Pull Strings]

9
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,500
[Adapted from the novel by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

10
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,930
If Changgeng

11
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,740
could see your change today,

12
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:44,900
he'd be so happy for you.

13
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,640
Come to think of it,

14
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,100
I must thank you for this armor.

15
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:57,490
What?

16
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:58,710
Well.

17
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:01,330
You gave this armor to me.

18
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,400
I did?

19
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,096
The other day, when the maids brought clothes,

20
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,770
there was armor hidden inside by magic.

21
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:09,570
The maids, low in power, didn't notice.

22
00:02:09,870 --> 00:02:10,846
They thought it was just an ordinary garment

23
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:11,870
and gave it to me.

24
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,606
I gave it to you?

25
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:17,290
As a human disciple,

26
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:19,100
you're truly thoughtful.

27
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,776
Thanks to your war armor.

28
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,890
Otherwise, the Little Prince would've been hurt.

29
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,496
This armor is a real treasure,

30
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,686
impervious to blades and spears.

31
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,990
You kept this fine thing hidden.

32
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:28,190
So composed.

33
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,376
Back then, Your Highness,

34
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,100
when the giant dragon pinned you down,

35
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,686
it was also this human disciple

36
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,100
who told me to shout to you

37
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,880
that you should transform into a dragon.

38
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,686
I did that?

39
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:39,286
What reached my ears

40
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:40,890
was your voice.

41
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,120
The formation is complete.

42
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,880
Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

43
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,886
What should I say?

44
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:46,606
Repeat what I say.

45
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:47,940
Repeat after me, loudly.

46
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,060
Your Highness,

47
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,886
Ao Jia faces you in dragon form,

48
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:53,500
already forsaking all brotherly ties.

49
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,686
He treats you this way,

50
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,660
so why go easy on him?

51
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:00,216
You could actually

52
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,976
pull off an advanced spell

53
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,010
like Voice Transmission.

54
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,686
The Human Clan's strength can't be underestimated.

55
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:05,710
No, no.

56
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,240
Well.

57
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:09,496
I've got something to take care of.

58
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,520
You two,

59
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:12,850
stick to the plan.

60
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,000
What's wrong with him?

61
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,190
This is just how he is.

62
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,286
What he loves most is giving others credit.

63
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:24,410
What he hates most is being praised.

64
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,800
Junior.

65
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,910
Junior.

66
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,256
Senior...

67
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,280
Senior.

68
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:31,566
What about the Second Prince?

69
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:32,056
Today, I

70
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,656
I told you to distract everyone.

71
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,680
What did you do?

72
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,656
I...

73
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,100
What exactly did you do?

74
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,686
I just walked over there

75
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,286
and waved at that paper puppet,

76
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:41,496
and the next second, it exploded.

77
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,540
I didn't do a thing.

78
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:44,450
Exploding paper puppets.

79
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,660
Those are all my tricks.

80
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:50,690
Who knows me this well,

81
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,940
acting on my exact plans beforehand?

82
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,500
It's like a heart-to-heart connection.

83
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,960
A heart-to-heart connection.

84
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,610
This armor protects against any blade.

85
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,220
It's a rare treasure indeed.

86
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,216
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

87
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,686
The Court's weapons and magic instruments

88
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,850
were all taken.

89
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:11,976
You could actually

90
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,846
pull off an advanced spell

91
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,496
like Voice Transmission.

92
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:17,200
The formation is complete. Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

93
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,900
I see.

94
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,630
It's a heart-to-heart connection.

95
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,696
Junior,

96
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,290
we share a heart-to-heart connection!

97
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,240
A heart-to-heart connection.

98
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,610
A heart-to-heart connection?

99
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,290
We share a heart-to-heart connection?

100
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,050
I don't feel it.

101
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,360
Is he talking about him and me?

102
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:48,820
[Episode 24]

103
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:12,510
Watch closely.

104
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,800
Yes.

105
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,410
The Sword fragment surfaced.

106
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,100
Ao Yi will soon seize power.

107
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:24,030
Westdawn Sect will surely lose patience.

108
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,490
Within three days,

109
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,100
they'll come for the Sword.

110
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,900
Be ready to fight at any moment.

111
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,290
Changshou, rest assured.

112
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,340
I've cultivated for a millennium,

113
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,730
yet my magic only served to arrange marriages.

114
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,486
Today, I can finally act like a real man

115
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:39,366
and have a real fight.

116
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,730
When I give the order,

117
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,286
you open the scroll.

118
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,016
Don't worry.

119
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,040
Just go for it.

120
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,286
Open it; Don't aim at me.

121
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:46,896
Aim it outside.

122
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,576
You go ahead.

123
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,096
I didn't tell you to open it now.

124
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,490
All right.

125
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,580
Stay calm. Stay calm.

126
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:54,460
I'm calm. I'm calm.

127
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,830
I'm calm.

128
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,340
I'll remind you once more.

129
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:03,020
One move makes or breaks it.

130
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,286
The day Westdawn Sect moves,

131
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:08,020
the Dragon Palace bows to the Celestial Court,

132
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:11,290
and that's when I rise.

133
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,190
What's wrong, Changshou?

134
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,810
A powerful surge of spiritual power

135
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:24,340
is attacking my paper butterflies.

136
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:26,630
Then are your butterflies all right?

137
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:38,490
A thousand years ago,

138
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:41,726
the Celestial Court left the Sea-Calming Pillar

139
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,700
but took away the Primordial Sword.

140
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,900
The message is this:

141
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:49,846
If the Dragon Palace of the East Sea ever disobeys,

142
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:51,660
they can open the Eye of the Sea

143
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,190
and doom the East Sea at any time.

144
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:54,410
But what happened today?

145
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,100
The Celestial Court gave me a fragment of the Primordial Sword.

146
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:02,050
It shows unmatched trust and sincerity.

147
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:04,850
They believe that with me here,

148
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:06,850
the Eye of the Sea will be safe.

149
00:08:07,310 --> 00:08:12,250
If I refuse, you can't take the fragment.

150
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:17,050
Your Majesty, you knew I would come.

151
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,406
You secretly urged my son, Ao Jia,

152
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:20,806
to claim the East Sea throne.

153
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:24,096
Then you lured Fairy Yunxiao here to seize the Sea-Calming Pillar.

154
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:26,286
Did you think your deeds in the East Sea

155
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,700
would escape my notice?

156
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:30,900
You noticed long ago.

157
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,700
So, for years, you feigned madness

158
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,150
to keep the First Prince from the throne.

159
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,820
You also led Fairy Yunxiao to Bear Island

160
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,010
to protect the Sea-Calming Pillar.

161
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,940
I've been the Dragon King for a thousand years.

162
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,730
Your petty tricks

163
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:49,790
are nothing to me.

164
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:51,100
Your Majesty,

165
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:52,870
you won't kill me?

166
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,890
If I meant to kill you,

167
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,940
that strike just now

168
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,250
would have left you doomed.

169
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,600
You won't kill me

170
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,840
only because you

171
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,770
need me.

172
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:12,650
What could I need from you?

173
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,480
The Celestial Court.

174
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,460
After the Deity-Demon War,

175
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:23,010
the Dragon Clan was granted the Four Seas.

176
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,250
You're the head of the Dragon Clan.

177
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:28,650
You've kept its place independent for a thousand years

178
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,890
because the Dragon Clan once pledged

179
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,670
to the Demon Clan.

180
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,250
A thousand years ago,

181
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:39,060
I was the best fighter of the Demon Emperor.

182
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,490
I still remember

183
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:46,850
the dread before the Demon Emperor.

184
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:50,100
So, a thousand years ago,

185
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:52,060
you turned on the Demon Emperor

186
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:54,470
and gave the Human Clan a great victory.

187
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:58,340
You wanted

188
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,730
to let the Dragon Clan be independent

189
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:04,890
in the world.

190
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:08,610
So, you want me

191
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:12,190
to ruin the grand wedding in three days

192
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,850
and drive the Celestial Court

193
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,850
out of the East Sea.

194
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:20,910
Good.

195
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:22,750
Very good.

196
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,580
Master Jin Chan,

197
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,080
I was right about you

198
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,850
after all.

199
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,650
Your Majesty, we are foes.

200
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,700
Why are you so sure.

201
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,580
I'd agree to help you?

202
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:41,176
If the Celestial Court steps into the East Sea,

203
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,820
your sect can't open the Eye of the Sea.

204
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:49,850
If I agree to fight the Celestial Court to the death,

205
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,010
even if we barely win,

206
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:55,980
we'd still have the East Sea as our enemy.

207
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,720
When the Celestial Court comes,

208
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,770
I can simply withdraw first.

209
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,180
Why exhaust myself in a battle here?

210
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,010
I can give you a reason.

211
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,320
This.

212
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:16,646
If you help me drive out the Celestial Court,

213
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:19,100
this Sword fragment will be yours.

214
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,220
The Dragon Clan of the Four Seas

215
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:28,250
all think you've lost your mind with age.

216
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,940
But in my eyes,

217
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:33,700
you hide the deepest schemes

218
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,220
across the Four Seas.

219
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:38,910
Very well.

220
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,440
In three days,

221
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,100
I will return.

222
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,530
You're having second thoughts?

223
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,120
No.

224
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,650
You have shown me true sincerity.

225
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,850
I should offer a gift in return.

226
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:02,456
My Dragon Palace lacks no treasure.

227
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,700
We need no gift from you.

228
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:10,300
The Chaos Bell.

229
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:16,130
In three days, if you are defeated,

230
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,890
this will be your sole chance to turn the tide.

231
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:20,510
Your Majesty,

232
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,610
don't miss this opportunity.

233
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,940
The Chaos Bell.

234
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:37,370
Why hasn't Senior returned yet?

235
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,630
Senior?

236
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:49,610
Senior, is that you?

237
00:12:49,870 --> 00:12:50,870
I'm here.

238
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,080
Senior?

239
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,910
Senior?

240
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,200
Senior?

241
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,130
It's not Senior.

242
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,846
What's this? Stop!

243
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:12,696
Quick, catch him!

244
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,056
He's escaping! Quick!

245
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,080
Get her!

246
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,576
If you don't work hard today,

247
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,130
the East Sea won't be vibrant tomorrow.

248
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,246
Their lions are not good enough,

249
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,820
because they haven't learned from me.

250
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,220
Make way!

251
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,320
Out of the way!

252
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,360
Go!

253
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,530
They're so odd.

254
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,490
They look truly overjoyed.

255
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:47,120
Maybe we

256
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,730
should join them?

257
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,270
Tomorrow?

258
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:54,980
Sure!

259
00:13:58,960 --> 00:13:59,646
What's wrong?

260
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:01,296
Ascendance disciple Lan Ling'e

261
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,980
has been seized by Dragon Palace guards.

262
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,576
The Turtle Minister invites all honored guests

263
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,940
to the Crystal Palace for a talk.

264
00:14:06,390 --> 00:14:07,176
What did you say?

265
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,370
You took Ling'e!

266
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:10,220
Bring the prisoner.

267
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:12,390
Senior.

268
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,526
Junior Ling'e.

269
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,550
Kneel!

270
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,120
Senior...

271
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:20,416
You guys are honored guests.

272
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,220
We shouldn't have stirred up conflict,

273
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:27,056
but this one crept into the palace depths

274
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,296
and shattered a glazed lantern.

275
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,296
I didn't shatter it.

276
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,370
Then who did?

277
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,696
And why sneak into the depths?

278
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,980
What are you plotting?

279
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,770
I didn't... I...

280
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:39,580
Senior, what do we do?

281
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:41,526
Just say the word,

282
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,576
and I'll go save her right now.

283
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,700
Don't rush in just yet.

284
00:14:43,790 --> 00:14:44,576
Let's watch a bit longer.

285
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,600
Wait.

286
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,000
Father,

287
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:50,700
could this be a misunderstanding?

288
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:52,096
It's just a glazed lantern.

289
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:52,420
Yes, exactly.

290
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:53,790
How could it come to this?

291
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,610
Yi,

292
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:58,770
that's my favorite glazed lantern!

293
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:02,486
She's broken His Majesty's glazed lantern.

294
00:15:02,510 --> 00:15:04,976
Next, she'll burn the Dragon Throne!

295
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:05,366
I...

296
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:06,630
What kind of reasoning is that?

297
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:07,790
Father.

298
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:10,606
Ascendance disciples are good people.

299
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:11,936
They would never damage

300
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,650
anything here.

301
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,010
Please trust me, Father.

302
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,250
Something's off.

303
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:19,886
- How can you trust humans?
- It's indeed fishy.

304
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:21,530
The Dragon King owns all of Lotus Hall.

305
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,580
Why would he care about one glazed lantern?

306
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:26,126
Junior is the suspicious one.

307
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,060
Who are you talking about?

308
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,370
If you mean no harm,

309
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:30,366
why sneak deep into the Dragon Palace?

310
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:31,460
What's your aim?

311
00:15:31,870 --> 00:15:32,576
Good question.

312
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:34,880
- There's surely something shady.
- Whose side are you on?

313
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,240
Our side.

314
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,820
I'm here to catch the villain.

315
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,730
Catch a villain?

316
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:40,976
I saw someone

317
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,336
sneaking into the Dragon Palace.

318
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,766
Worried for Little Prince's safety,

319
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,060
I followed them in secret.

320
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,006
They're the ones who broke the glazed lantern.

321
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:46,936
It has nothing to do with me.

322
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,960
Describe it then.

323
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,180
What did the figure look like?

324
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,456
I only saw their back,

325
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,490
not their face.

326
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,600
Their back?

327
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,370
Even a back shows human or dragon.

328
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:56,770
Any dragon features?

329
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,056
Your Majesty,

330
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,360
they were a human, not a dragon.

331
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:13,220
We have only one exit.

332
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:14,580
Turtle Minister,

333
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:17,576
aside from Yi returning yesterday,

334
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:18,700
in the past half-month,

335
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,576
was the Water Dragon Spout opened?

336
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,250
No, Your Majesty. It wasn't.

337
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,456
Those entering the East Sea

338
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,130
were all brought by the Little Prince.

339
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:29,976
Last night, guards combed the Dragon Palace

340
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,126
but found no outsider.

341
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:32,180
So, it's clear:

342
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:34,820
This woman keeps spouting nonsense.

343
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,486
Your Majesty, everything I said is true.

344
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,010
Please believe me, Your Majesty.

345
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,216
Turtle Minister,

346
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,696
lock her up in the dungeon first.

347
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,296
Father.

348
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,366
Enough, Yi.

349
00:16:47,390 --> 00:16:49,006
Tomorrow is your grand wedding.

350
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:51,296
Why let her ruin it?

351
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,486
Turtle Minister, take her to the dungeon.

352
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,940
I'll deal with this after the grand wedding.

353
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:57,120
Aunt.

354
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,010
Don't be impulsive.

355
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,720
If we don't save her now, she's done for.

356
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,180
No, no.

357
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:01,976
Senior, Aunt.

358
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,420
Junior.

359
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:03,750
Junior.

360
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,960
Senior.

361
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,880
Improve yourself.

362
00:17:09,350 --> 00:17:10,326
Turn over a new leaf.

363
00:17:10,350 --> 00:17:11,380
Get tortured.

364
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:12,726
Junior.

365
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:13,246
Ling'e.

366
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:14,270
Junior.

367
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,920
No.

368
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,000
I must see the Dragon King

369
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:29,976
to rescue Ling'e.

370
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:30,616
Aunt.

371
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,486
Aunt, you mustn't!

372
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:32,940
What are we waiting for?

373
00:17:33,070 --> 00:17:33,980
We came here

374
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,940
to foil the Westdawn Sect's plot.

375
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,806
If we fight the Dragon Palace now,

376
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,696
we'd give Westdawn an opening.

377
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,656
I know, but Ling'e...

378
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,680
Aunt.

379
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:43,490
If Uncle Jiu Wu were here,

380
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:44,750
what would he do?

381
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,400
Changshou,

382
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,010
you're the cleverest.

383
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,570
What should we do then?

384
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:08,350
I'll follow your lead.

385
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:10,590
Junior said

386
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:13,570
she saw a mysterious figure.

387
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:17,290
A mysterious person broke the glazed lantern.

388
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,250
Junior Ling'e may be quirky,

389
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:21,246
but she's not one to make things up.

390
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:23,376
I believe she saw someone.

391
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,490
I believe her too.

392
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:27,770
But everyone says no one else was there.

393
00:18:28,350 --> 00:18:31,330
The point isn't whether it's true

394
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:34,526
but how to make everyone believe

395
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:36,460
that this mystery person exists.

396
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,570
If we don't find this mystery person,

397
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,860
then we can

398
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,090
create a mysterious figure

399
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,936
so we can show everyone that in the Dragon Palace,

400
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,980
such a person really exists.

401
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:50,070
Wouldn't that solve it?

402
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,510
Senior,

403
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:03,490
our Skyrend's magic arts

404
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,770
are all righteous divine abilities.

405
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:08,770
You want me to pose as a mystery man to assassinate?

406
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,920
I

407
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,660
I have no confidence.

408
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,050
Junior Xuanya,

409
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:15,730
I understand all your concerns.

410
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:18,006
After all, under normal circumstances,

411
00:19:18,030 --> 00:19:21,086
this work is usually done by Junior Ling'e.

412
00:19:21,110 --> 00:19:22,570
But she's not here right now,

413
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:26,570
so I can only pick you

414
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,250
or Aunt Jiu Jiu.

415
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:36,136
It can only be you.

416
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,700
You're the only one for this job.

417
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:38,790
No one else can do it.

418
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,416
To save Junior Ling'e,

419
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,856
we must make the Dragon Clan believe

420
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,486
there's a mysterious person in the Dragon Palace.

421
00:19:44,510 --> 00:19:45,510
You pick a target.

422
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:47,900
Just make a failed attempt.

423
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:49,030
Go for it.

424
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:51,806
But the Dragon Palace is heavily guarded.

425
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:53,376
Guards patrol closely.

426
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:54,400
I

427
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,380
I can't sneak in.

428
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,770
Leave that to me.

429
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:47,220
Lost and found!

430
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,700
Let me see.

431
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:50,790
You...

432
00:20:51,590 --> 00:20:53,290
You'll get it when I'm done.

433
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:55,490
Hurry up then.

434
00:20:56,750 --> 00:20:57,750
Success.

435
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:00,270
What success?

436
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:02,456
You little rascal, what's your scheme?

437
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,376
Do you still need me?

438
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,980
Aunt.

439
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:07,220
You'll be very useful later.

440
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,766
Let me out!

441
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:11,566
You thick-headed, blind dragons!

442
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:13,176
We're here to rescue you.

443
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,380
Why lock me up here?

444
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,330
Anyone there? Let me out!

445
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,000
Senior.

446
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,290
When will you come save me?

447
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:26,570
Make sure she improves herself

448
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,380
and turns over a new leaf.

449
00:21:30,110 --> 00:21:31,180
Torture her!

450
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:36,086
Stupid Senior! Wicked Senior!

451
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:37,570
Scoundrel Senior.

452
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,400
Young lady,

453
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,620
who are you calling Senior?

454
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:46,570
I'm not your Senior.

455
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:49,380
Are you tired of shouting?

456
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:51,660
If so, come with me.

457
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,980
I thought the execution was after the wedding.

458
00:21:54,030 --> 00:21:55,176
Don't be so hasty.

459
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,250
I'm still young.

460
00:21:58,790 --> 00:21:59,790
So young.

461
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,620
Assassinating at the Dragon Palace

462
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,290
is surprisingly hard.

463
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,900
This must be a trial from Senior.

464
00:22:09,070 --> 00:22:10,420
I won't disappoint him.

465
00:22:13,270 --> 00:22:14,860
I'm still young and beautiful.

466
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,490
I'm still in the bloom of youth.

467
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:18,766
I've never been in love!

468
00:22:18,790 --> 00:22:19,810
Turtle Minister.

469
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:22,180
That is indeed a pity.

470
00:22:22,350 --> 00:22:24,420
Listen. Love is really fun.

471
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,480
Well.

472
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:29,566
You two, step outside.

473
00:22:29,590 --> 00:22:30,980
Guard the door.

474
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:32,400
Yes.

475
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,200
No.

476
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,136
What's that supposed to mean?

477
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:36,160
Please.

478
00:22:47,830 --> 00:22:50,566
I'll be killed after I've had my fill?

479
00:22:50,590 --> 00:22:52,860
Right, it's like a buffet.

480
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,176
Got it.

481
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,420
Then I won't hold back.

482
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,070
Shh.

483
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,920
Is it good?

484
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:28,486
Your Majesty, Your Majesty.

485
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:30,050
Miss, don't be afraid.

486
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:32,566
I prepared these for you.

487
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,700
Eat and drink to your heart's content.

488
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,000
Really?

489
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:38,920
Then I'll dig in.

490
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,160
What are you doing?

491
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,176
Your Majesty, well.

492
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,046
Don't come any closer.

493
00:23:56,070 --> 00:23:57,216
I only had a few bites of your food.

494
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,286
I can spit it out.

495
00:23:58,310 --> 00:23:59,766
And you just told me to eat it.

496
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:01,330
Don't come closer!

497
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,570
Help!

498
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:11,000
What the hell is this?

499
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:13,140
It's indeed the Chaos Bell!

500
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,810
Where did you get this?

501
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,700
It's a keepsake from my mother.

502
00:24:27,590 --> 00:24:28,590
You...

503
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,090
Who are you?

504
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,290
I'm Lan Ling'e,

505
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,176
a disciple of Jade Division, Ascendance Sect.

506
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:36,860
Lan Ling'e.

507
00:24:42,750 --> 00:24:43,456
What are you laughing at?

508
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:44,526
That's the truth.

509
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:47,006
Miss, you seem unaware

510
00:24:47,030 --> 00:24:48,856
of your true identity.

511
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:51,050
How could a mere Ascendance disciple

512
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:53,140
wear the Chaos Bell?

513
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,570
My true identity?

514
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:01,530
Do you not know your origins?

515
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,240
You're also

516
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:26,330
here for the assassination?

517
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:28,810
You too?

518
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,270
Assassination?

519
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:36,200
Exactly.

520
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:39,380
I hid you in the East Sea for half a month

521
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:41,570
for this very plan.

522
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:44,980
Changgeng's whole setup in the East Sea

523
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,810
revolves around Ao Yi.

524
00:25:48,110 --> 00:25:50,050
If we can eliminate Ao Yi,

525
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:54,290
Changgeng will have no moves left.

526
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,570
Changgeng.

527
00:25:58,590 --> 00:25:59,590
Relax.

528
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,010
Leave this to me.

529
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,110
Remember:

530
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:05,180
Act in secret.

531
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

532
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,700
know we're behind this.

533
00:26:10,790 --> 00:26:11,790
Better yet,

534
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,620
frame the Ascendance Sect.

535
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,160
How do I pull that off?

536
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,460
I have a plan.

537
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:29,050
You just do your best.

538
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:37,176
I knew he had a plan.

539
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:37,856
I knew

540
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,620
he wouldn't have me attempt this alone.

541
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:42,730
He?

542
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:47,940
Did Senior send you to meet me?

543
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,640
Senior?

544
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:54,140
You call him Senior?

545
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,240
So, you're a fellow cultivator.

546
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,530
My apologies. My apologies.

547
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,660
Since we're fellow cultivators,

548
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:02,230
there's no need for such formality.

549
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,880
But

550
00:27:04,110 --> 00:27:06,530
how come I've never seen you before?

551
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,200
Your Senior

552
00:27:10,270 --> 00:27:12,216
hid me in the East Sea half a month ago.

553
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,566
He told me to stay out of sight

554
00:27:13,590 --> 00:27:14,806
and keep to the shadows.

555
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:16,270
That's why none of you have seen me.

556
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:21,770
So, Senior had this planned all along.

557
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:24,940
Truly far-sighted. Impressive.

558
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

559
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:30,570
know we're behind this.

560
00:27:31,590 --> 00:27:32,590
Better yet,

561
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:35,570
frame the Ascendance Sect.

562
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,530
Brilliant!

563
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,006
I never imagined your disguise

564
00:27:42,030 --> 00:27:43,460
could be so masterful.

565
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:46,006
It's seamless, absolutely lifelike.

566
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:47,730
I can't find a single flaw.

567
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,376
This is but an ordinary disguise.

568
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:53,490
Ordinary?

569
00:27:57,590 --> 00:27:58,590
Listen.

570
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,940
With this disguise, the assassination

571
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:03,140
will surely mislead the Dragon Palace.

572
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,180
As Senior said,

573
00:28:06,720 --> 00:28:09,380
I want the Dragon Palace to mistake me for the assassin.

574
00:28:09,510 --> 00:28:11,180
That is exactly the goal.

575
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:17,220
His schemes are truly brilliant.

576
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:19,250
Each plan is so meticulously arranged.

577
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,200
Miss,

578
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:23,250
I've already scouted the road ahead.

579
00:28:23,920 --> 00:28:25,180
For this assassination,

580
00:28:26,310 --> 00:28:28,090
allow me to guide you.

581
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:30,290
With you leading the way,

582
00:28:30,510 --> 00:28:31,860
I'm much relieved.

583
00:28:34,510 --> 00:28:35,510
Please.

584
00:28:48,920 --> 00:28:49,920
Shh.

585
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:55,920
Sir,

586
00:28:56,590 --> 00:28:58,900
who exactly are we assassinating?

587
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:02,400
What?

588
00:29:03,070 --> 00:29:05,660
He didn't tell you?

589
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,290
Senior only told me to assassinate.

590
00:29:08,550 --> 00:29:10,700
But he didn't say who the target was.

591
00:29:12,310 --> 00:29:13,570
I see.

592
00:29:14,310 --> 00:29:15,976
None of us knows the full plan.

593
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:16,896
This way, if anyone is exposed,

594
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,280
there's still a chance to recover.

595
00:29:18,550 --> 00:29:19,770
He is

596
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,980
indeed cautious.

597
00:29:22,310 --> 00:29:23,770
I see.

598
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:26,420
Only Senior could plan like this.

599
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,940
Truly unfathomable.

600
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:29,920
Listen carefully.

601
00:29:30,590 --> 00:29:32,290
Our target for this assassination is

602
00:29:33,790 --> 00:29:35,530
the Second Prince, Ao Yi.

603
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,200
Ao Yi?

604
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:42,050
I see.

605
00:29:42,750 --> 00:29:45,010
Given the Little Prince's ties to Ascendance Sect,

606
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,980
Senior must have arranged this.

607
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:48,936
He is surely the best choice.

608
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:49,960
Exactly.

609
00:29:50,030 --> 00:29:51,766
With the Second Prince's ties to Ascendance Sect,

610
00:29:51,790 --> 00:29:53,770
he is the most fitting candidate.

611
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:54,976
Then let's act now.

612
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:55,806
Let's do it.

613
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:56,830
Go!

614
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:05,010
Oh, no, no!

615
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:10,010
Ling'e was wronged for trying to catch a spy

616
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,176
within our Dragon Palace.

617
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:13,380
How can I just abandon her?

618
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:15,660
Ling'e, I'm coming for you!

619
00:30:37,110 --> 00:30:38,110
He's coming out!

620
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:39,806
This is our perfect chance to act.

621
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:41,860
This must be Senior's design.

622
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:43,900
I see.

623
00:30:44,590 --> 00:30:45,590
Let's go.

624
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,010
The East Sea's Wasteland is vast.

625
00:31:12,550 --> 00:31:13,770
Even footsteps echo here.

626
00:31:44,310 --> 00:31:45,770
Not a single guard in sight.

627
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:49,240
So, the Dragon Clan's restoration

628
00:31:49,750 --> 00:31:50,900
brooks no delay.

629
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:58,526
Ling'e, it's Ao Yi.

630
00:31:58,550 --> 00:31:59,550
I've come to rescue you.

631
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,000
Miss,

632
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:02,770
now's the perfect time.

633
00:32:03,830 --> 00:32:05,900
Perfect? Really?

634
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,660
No one's around.

635
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:10,160
Perfect to strike.

636
00:32:11,830 --> 00:32:13,140
No one's around?

637
00:32:13,750 --> 00:32:15,110
That's precisely why we shouldn't.

638
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:16,350
No.

639
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:18,140
What kind of logic is that?

640
00:32:21,790 --> 00:32:24,980
You want to assassinate in public?

641
00:32:26,590 --> 00:32:27,376
Of course.

642
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:29,140
Otherwise, why attempt this assassination?

643
00:32:36,790 --> 00:32:37,566
My fellow cultivator,

644
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:39,006
I understand that as an assassin,

645
00:32:39,030 --> 00:32:40,376
you have your own artistic vision.

646
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:42,460
But please respect my professionalism.

647
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,376
Here's the plan.

648
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,400
In a moment,

649
00:32:44,640 --> 00:32:45,486
you keep watch here.

650
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:47,460
I'll perform the assassination, got it?

651
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,290
Got it. I'll go gather an audience.

652
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,176
Why gather an audience?

653
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,566
To watch you perform the assassination!

654
00:32:53,590 --> 00:32:54,176
You're crazy!

655
00:32:54,200 --> 00:32:55,250
Shh.

656
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,696
Alright, let's both calm down.

657
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,176
Just wait here for a moment,

658
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:01,916
and watch me perform.

659
00:33:01,940 --> 00:33:02,177
But...

660
00:33:02,201 --> 00:33:04,220
No buts, listen to me.

661
00:33:07,110 --> 00:33:08,110
Amateur.

662
00:33:14,750 --> 00:33:15,750
Ling'e.

663
00:33:16,310 --> 00:33:17,310
Ling'e.

664
00:33:17,880 --> 00:33:18,900
I'm Ao Yi.

665
00:33:19,160 --> 00:33:20,160
I've come to rescue you.

666
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:25,350
Le'er.

667
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:25,660
Who's there?

668
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:26,766
Assassin!

669
00:33:26,790 --> 00:33:28,620
Guards! Catch the assassin!

670
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:30,030
Assassin!

671
00:33:31,030 --> 00:33:32,416
Completing the mission this way,

672
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,696
you are truly unpredictable.

673
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,050
Guards! Catch the assassin!

674
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:36,720
Don't run!

675
00:33:38,590 --> 00:33:39,086
Stop!

676
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:39,770
Assassin!

677
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,180
Run!

678
00:33:40,880 --> 00:33:41,880
Assassin!

679
00:33:44,110 --> 00:33:45,940
Guards! Catch the assassin!

680
00:33:49,070 --> 00:33:50,070
Don't run!

681
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,480
Oh, no.

682
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:55,040
What if that cultivator thinks Le'er is the Second Prince?

683
00:33:56,510 --> 00:33:57,510
The Chaos Bell

684
00:33:58,110 --> 00:33:59,570
is a primordial supreme treasure.

685
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:02,086
It can suppress the chaotic world

686
00:34:02,110 --> 00:34:04,286
and bend time and space.

687
00:34:04,310 --> 00:34:06,420
But after the Deity-Demon War,

688
00:34:07,110 --> 00:34:09,050
it vanished without a trace.

689
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:11,820
It has not been seen for a thousand years,

690
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:16,170
until you appeared.

691
00:34:19,190 --> 00:34:20,570
Isn't this just a bell?

692
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:21,800
Is it really so mystical?

693
00:34:24,630 --> 00:34:25,630
Miss,

694
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:27,740
when you wear this bell,

695
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:30,690
at the brink of life and death,

696
00:34:31,400 --> 00:34:34,420
have you noticed anything odd?

697
00:34:37,070 --> 00:34:38,530
Anything odd?

698
00:34:56,190 --> 00:34:57,190
The Chaos Bell?

699
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:05,340
The Chaos Bell can bend time and space.

700
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:09,170
But your spiritual power is too shallow.

701
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:11,420
It can only turn back a moment.

702
00:35:12,030 --> 00:35:14,050
But if the Chaos Bell's original owner

703
00:35:14,670 --> 00:35:16,940
activates the Chaos Bell's power,

704
00:35:17,550 --> 00:35:20,090
they can travel back a thousand years.

705
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:23,380
The Chaos Bell's original owner?

706
00:35:27,590 --> 00:35:28,590
I've worn this bell

707
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:30,690
since I was a child.

708
00:35:31,230 --> 00:35:34,090
My mother said it was a keepsake from my father.

709
00:35:44,710 --> 00:35:45,710
A resemblance...

710
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:48,000
So alike.

711
00:35:48,550 --> 00:35:50,976
Resemblance in brow and eyes.

712
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:51,780
Resemble who?

713
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,170
The Chaos Bell's original owner.

714
00:35:53,550 --> 00:35:55,490
Your birth father.

715
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:05,320
Where is he?

716
00:36:13,800 --> 00:36:14,800
Le'er, watch out!

717
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:22,150
My father?

718
00:36:24,030 --> 00:36:25,170
You know my father?

719
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:26,166
He's still alive?

720
00:36:26,190 --> 00:36:27,570
Then can you take me to see him?

721
00:36:27,630 --> 00:36:28,820
Do you really want to know?

722
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:30,460
Yes, I'd like to know.

723
00:36:30,510 --> 00:36:32,206
- Alright, your father...
- Your Majesty!

724
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:33,006
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

725
00:36:33,030 --> 00:36:34,006
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

726
00:36:34,030 --> 00:36:35,456
Good heavens!

727
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:36,976
Why rush in at a time like this?

728
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:37,860
Then I'll go.

729
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,170
No, no, Your Majesty.

730
00:36:39,590 --> 00:36:41,090
An assassin has entered the palace.

731
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:44,050
Catch the assassin!

732
00:36:44,190 --> 00:36:46,010
Catch the assassin!

733
00:36:49,070 --> 00:36:50,210
Audacious assassin!

734
00:36:53,590 --> 00:36:54,590
Warrior Eel.

735
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,550
Your Highness.

736
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,480
Your Highness?

737
00:37:01,110 --> 00:37:01,976
Why is it you?

738
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:03,820
Why did you try to assassinate?

739
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:05,690
Assassinate?

740
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:06,760
Me?

741
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:08,400
Assassinate whom?

742
00:37:08,630 --> 00:37:09,420
Assassinate...

743
00:37:09,590 --> 00:37:10,650
Assassinate whom?

744
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:12,570
Who do you mean by that?

745
00:37:17,630 --> 00:37:19,170
What? Miss.

746
00:37:19,550 --> 00:37:20,550
You're so fast.

747
00:37:23,190 --> 00:37:24,190
See you next time.

748
00:37:26,230 --> 00:37:27,260
See you next time.

749
00:37:29,230 --> 00:37:30,230
I never thought

750
00:37:30,630 --> 00:37:33,610
that so many dangers lurk in the shadows.

751
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:35,530
All these years,

752
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:37,860
Senior's always stuck to this principle.

753
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,780
I truly admire that.

754
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,860
Don't praise me now.

755
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:43,510
Go.

756
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:45,760
Xuanya.

757
00:37:46,630 --> 00:37:47,416
Willgate,

758
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:49,336
our Tushita Palace's newest item.

759
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:50,650
Just in time to use it today.

760
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:51,860
It seems

761
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,976
today's assassination was a success.

762
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:55,976
Senior's plan is flawless.

763
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:58,130
I merely acted according to plan.

764
00:38:00,230 --> 00:38:01,776
Xuanya, you're too modest.

765
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:03,776
You improvised to strike the Little Prince,

766
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:05,000
snatching victory from danger.

767
00:38:05,400 --> 00:38:06,296
Impressive!

768
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,460
Impressive!

769
00:38:07,670 --> 00:38:08,456
No, no.

770
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,686
It all went as Senior planned.

771
00:38:10,710 --> 00:38:12,940
Senior had a cultivator help.

772
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:15,650
That cultivator was thorough and convincing.

773
00:38:16,440 --> 00:38:18,170
When he moved to kill the Little Prince,

774
00:38:18,230 --> 00:38:19,486
he truly meant to do it.

775
00:38:19,510 --> 00:38:21,046
You scared me!

776
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:22,090
In the end, he failed

777
00:38:22,230 --> 00:38:23,380
with a loud wail.

778
00:38:23,630 --> 00:38:25,006
It was seemingly comical,

779
00:38:25,030 --> 00:38:27,900
yet he hid wisdom in folly.

780
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,010
I wish to meet

781
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:32,780
this cultivator again if I can.

782
00:38:40,190 --> 00:38:41,190
Darn it!

783
00:38:41,590 --> 00:38:43,300
If I could appear,

784
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:45,820
you'd be no match for me.

785
00:38:47,550 --> 00:38:48,550
Who's there?

786
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:52,760
Fairy Yunxiao.

787
00:39:27,070 --> 00:39:32,850
♪ See mortal joys and sorrows ♪

788
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:40,220
♪ Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds ♪

789
00:39:41,750 --> 00:39:47,800
♪ Alas, love has many twists and turns ♪

790
00:39:48,430 --> 00:39:54,880
♪ Memories filled with sorrow ♪

791
00:39:55,620 --> 00:40:02,740
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

792
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:10,020
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

793
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:17,726
♪ Tearfully, this life's bond is not over ♪

794
00:40:17,750 --> 00:40:24,920
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪

795
00:40:41,060 --> 00:40:46,230
♪ Down a few more cups of wine ♪

796
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:54,340
♪ Through land and sea, I ask you to come ♪

797
00:40:55,530 --> 00:41:01,470
♪ For honor's sake, upright and grand ♪

798
00:41:02,170 --> 00:41:09,250
♪ Alas, our story is short ♪

799
00:41:09,590 --> 00:41:16,700
♪ Slowly, wishes turn to regret ♪

800
00:41:17,020 --> 00:41:23,500
♪ You've gone afar, like mist fading ♪

801
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:31,490
♪ Tears fall, this fate's not done ♪

802
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:39,700
♪ Past fragments vanish into night ♪
